<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 회원가입</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0e0f11;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --text-muted: #555;
            --danger: #f87171;
            --input-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg); color: #fff;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh; overflow-x: hidden; letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .signup-container {
            width: 100%; max-width: 420px; padding: 40px;
            background: #111214;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            text-decoration: none; color: #fff; display: block; margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .logo span { color: var(--danger); }

        .header-msg { margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .header-msg h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .header-msg p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }

        .form-group { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .form-group label {
            display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
            color: #444; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        input {
            width: 100%; padding: 14px 16px;
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #fff; font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            outline: none;
        }
        input::placeholder { color: #333; }
        input:focus {
            border-color: rgba(248,113,113,0.4);
            background: rgba(248,113,113,0.04);
        }

        .btn-signup {
            width: 100%; padding: 14px; margin-top: 8px;
            background: var(--danger);
            color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-signup:hover { background: #f95e5e; transform: translateY(-2px); }

        .auth-footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .auth-footer a { color: #aaa; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 4px; }
        .auth-footer a:hover { color: #fff; }

        .divider {
            border: none; border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            margin: 28px 0 24px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="signup-container">
    <a href="/login-form" class="logo">Commit<span>Mate</span>.</a>

    <div class="header-msg">
        <h2>새로운 시작</h2>
        <p>나만의 커밋 동료들을 만나보세요.</p>
    </div>

    <form action="/signup" method="post">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>이메일</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="name@example.com" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>닉네임</label>
            <input type="text" name="nickname" placeholder="멋진 닉네임을 입력하세요" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <label>비밀번호</label>
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="8자 이상 입력하세요" required>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-signup">계정 생성하기</button>
    </form>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div class="auth-footer">
        이미 계정이 있으신가요? <a href="/login-form">로그인</a>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>